        <untitled-ontology-20:ID rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">http://www.semanticweb.org/sumaiyasuravee/ontologies/2023/5/untitled-ontology-20#Needs_help_going_to_the_toilet</untitled-ontology-20:ID>
